"\n"
"Your registration for the consultation “%(poll_title)s” has been received.\n"
"\n"
"To confirm it and reach your ballot, open this link:\n"
"\n"
"%(ballot_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Voting is open until %(closes_at)s."

#: templates/registrations/mail/confirmation.txt:11
